  "goodToKnow": "Kurieren means to cure or heal: eine Krankheit kurieren. You'll often hear auskurieren, to get fully over an illness: Kurier dich erst richtig aus! Figuratively, von etwas kuriert sein means to be cured of something, to have learned your lesson. It's related to die Kur, a stay at a spa town, which German health insurance still sometimes pays for; towns with Bad in their name, like Bad Ems, are Kurorte. From Latin curare, to care for."
